     [1m-c[0m      Use time when file status was last changed for sorting or printing.

     [1m--color[0m=[4mwhen[24m
             Output colored escape sequences based on [4mwhen[24m, which may be set to either [1malways[0m,
             [1mauto[0m, or [1mnever[0m.

             [1malways[0m will make [1mls[0m always output color.  If TERM is unset or set to an invalid
             terminal, then [1mls[0m will fall back to explicit ANSI escape sequences without the help
             of termcap(5).  [1malways[0m is the default if [1m--color[0m is specified without an argument.
